  "description_snippet": "#### SUMMARY\nThe FedCM prompt has two dialog types [1]: bubble and modal. The bubble dialog renders near the top-right of the page while keeping the page interactive.\n\nBy opening the autofill prompt before the FedCM bubble, the autofill prompt will render below the FedCM bubble. The page can refocus"
